        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "\nFinal Residence Remaining Cedarvale\n\nDNG New Homes and Oakwood Group are delighted to present The Colt Collection.\n\nA rare opportunity to acquire the final remaining residence within this exclusive The Colt Collection, Cedarvale is an exceptional five-bedroom home extending to approximately 259 sq.m., offering an outstanding standard of contemporary living.\n\nDesigned with a strong emphasis on scale, proportion and quality, the home features generous, well-proportioned living spaces complemented by refined finishes and meticulous attention to detail throughout. The result is a sophisticated and highly considered family residence, combining style, comfort and functionality in equal measure.\n\nCedarvale is ideally positioned on Torquay Road in the heart of Foxrock, an area renowned for its elegance, tranquillity and established neighbourhood charm. This prime location offers effortless access to a wealth of amenities, including excellent schools, boutique shops, cafés, restaurants and a host of sporting and recreational facilities. The nearby suburbs of Blackrock, Monkstown, Sandyford and Dundrum further enhance the lifestyle offering, providing everything from coastal walks and leisure facilities to premium retail destinations.\n\nJust a short stroll from Foxrock Village and within easy reach of the Luas at Central Park, this exceptional setting combines the serenity of leafy suburban living with seamless connectivity to Dublin city centre and beyond.\n\nFoxrock Village itself is a vibrant and sought-after neighbourhood, offering an excellent selection of boutiques, cafés, restaurants and specialist food stores. Local favourites such as The Gables and KERB are complemented by Thomas's of Foxrock, providing a premium selection of fine foods and wines.\n\nCedarvale also offers an exceptional setting for those who enjoy an active lifestyle. Foxrock Golf Club is close by, with Leopardstown Golf Centre, local rugby, tennis and GAA clubs all within easy reach. Leopardstown Racecourse further enhances the area's sporting and social appeal, hosting events throughout the year.\n\nFamilies will appreciate the home's proximity to some of Dublin's most highly regarded schools. Nord Anglia International School Dublin is nearby, while Loreto College Foxrock is just a short distance away. Blackrock College, St. Andrew's College and University College Dublin at Belfield are also within easy reach, providing a wealth of educational opportunities.\n\nNestled within this exceptional setting, Cedarvale combines contemporary architectural design with meticulous craftsmanship and superior finishes. Every aspect of the home has been carefully considered to deliver modern comfort, style and elegance, creating an exceptional family residence in one of Dublin's most desirable neighbourhoods.\n\nPlease contact DNG to book your private viewing today."
      },
